m the earlier Tchefuncte culture and into the Baytown and Troyville cultures, and later the Coles Creek and Plum Bayou cultures. It is considered ancestral to the historic Natchez and Taensa peoples."}],"facts":[],"people":{},"media":{},"names":["Culture de Marksville","Marksville culture","マークスビル文化"]}